{"seq":2,"slug":"sound-insulation-noise-control","title":"隔声与噪声控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/sound-insulation-noise-control","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"隔声与噪声控制\">隔声与噪声控制</h1><p>楼上小孩跑跳的&quot;咚咚&quot;声、隔壁的电视、窗外的车流——住宅最常见的投诉几乎都关于&quot;挡不住的声音&quot;。隔声要解决的正是这件事：如何把不想要的声音挡在房间外面。它与 <a href=\"room-acoustics-fundamentals\">室内声学基础</a> 互为表里——后者管同一房间内声音如何分布，本篇管声音如何在房间之间传递、又如何被构件阻挡。本篇聚焦空气声隔声、撞击声隔声的物理机制与噪声控制的路径治理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两类隔声与隔声量\">核心概念：两类隔声与隔声量</h2><p>按声音的传播方式，隔声分两类，机理与对策截然不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空气声隔声</strong>：声源在空气中发声（说话、电视、车流），声波撞击隔墙使其振动，再向另一侧辐射。对策是阻止墙体振动传声。</li>\n<li><strong>撞击声隔声（固体声）</strong>：声源直接撞击结构（脚步、拖椅、敲击），振动沿楼板、墙体等固体传播，绕过空气直达远处。对策是隔振、断开固体连续。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>空气声隔声能力用<strong>隔声量 R（dB）</strong> 衡量，定义为入射声功率与透射声功率之比的对数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>τ</mi></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = 10\\log_{10}\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\quad(\\mathrm{dB})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">dB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是透射系数。工程上用计权隔声量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把全频段隔声曲线归纳为单一数值便于比对。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Src[声源房间] --&gt; Air[空气声&lt;br/&gt;说话/电视]&#10;  Src --&gt; Imp[撞击声&lt;br/&gt;脚步/敲击]&#10;  Air --&gt; Wall[隔墙振动] --&gt; Trans[透射声]&#10;  Imp --&gt; Struct[结构传播&lt;br/&gt;绕过空气] --&gt; Flank[侧向传声 flanking]&#10;  Trans --&gt; Recv((接收房间))&#10;  Flank --&gt; Recv&#10;  Leak[孔洞/缝隙 漏声] --&gt; Recv\">flowchart TD\n  Src[声源房间] --&gt; Air[空气声&lt;br/&gt;说话/电视]\n  Src --&gt; Imp[撞击声&lt;br/&gt;脚步/敲击]\n  Air --&gt; Wall[隔墙振动] --&gt; Trans[透射声]\n  Imp --&gt; Struct[结构传播&lt;br/&gt;绕过空气] --&gt; Flank[侧向传声 flanking]\n  Trans --&gt; Recv((接收房间))\n  Flank --&gt; Recv\n  Leak[孔洞/缝隙 漏声] --&gt; Recv</pre><p>特别注意图中的<strong>侧向传声（flanking）</strong> 和<strong>漏声</strong>：声音常常不走&quot;正门&quot;（隔墙本身），而绕过隔墙从侧墙、楼板、管线洞口、缝隙渗透。一个再厚的隔墙，只要墙脚有缝或穿了未封堵的管道，隔声量就会断崖式下跌——这是隔声工程&quot;短板效应&quot;最典型的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量定律-空气声隔声的根本规律\">质量定律：空气声隔声的根本规律</h2><p>空气声隔声最根本的规律是<strong>质量定律（Mass Law）</strong>：构件单位面积质量越大、频率越高，隔声量越好。理论上质量每翻倍或频率每翻倍，隔声量约增加 6 dB：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>47</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\approx 20\\log_{10}(m \\cdot f) - 47\\quad(\\mathrm{dB})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">47</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">dB</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是面密度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{kg/m^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">kg/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是频率。质量定律解释了为什么混凝土墙比石膏板隔声好。但单纯堆质量代价高昂，于是有了更聪明的<strong>多层复合墙体</strong>：两层板材中间夹空气或弹性层（如&quot;质量-弹簧-质量&quot;系统），在中高频可远超同等质量的单层墙。不过这类结构存在两个&quot;陷阱频率&quot;——<strong>共振频率</strong>（低频处隔声反而下降）和<strong>吻合效应</strong>（声波波长与板弯曲波吻合时，某中高频隔声出现深谷），设计时要把这两个谷错开关心频段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>隔声策略</th>\n<th>物理原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加大面密度</td>\n<td>质量定律</td>\n<td>简单可靠</td>\n<td>笨重、+6 dB 须翻倍质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多层复合（双墙）</td>\n<td>质量-弹簧-质量</td>\n<td>轻质高效</td>\n<td>有共振/吻合谷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔振断开</td>\n<td>阻断固体声路径</td>\n<td>治撞击声根本</td>\n<td>构造复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密封堵漏</td>\n<td>消除漏声短板</td>\n<td>性价比极高</td>\n<td>易被施工忽视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"撞击声控制-从源头隔振\">撞击声控制：从源头隔振</h2><p>撞击声靠固体传播，质量定律对它几乎无效，必须从&quot;断开固体连续性&quot;入手。撞击声隔声用<strong>计权规范化撞击声压级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{n,w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 评价，数值越小越好（与隔声量相反）。三条路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>源头减振</strong>：楼面铺地毯、弹性地板、橡胶垫，让撞击能量在产生处就被软化。</li>\n<li><strong>浮筑楼板（floating floor）</strong>：在结构楼板上铺一层弹性垫（如减振垫、岩棉），再浇面层，形成&quot;质量-弹簧&quot;隔振系统，是住宅楼板撞击声控制的主流做法。</li>\n<li><strong>隔振吊顶</strong>：用弹性吊件把吊顶与结构楼板软连接，阻断振动下传。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>楼板的撞击声与空气声往往需同时达标，GB 50118-2010 对住宅分户楼板的空气声隔声量与撞击声压级均规定限值（来源：<a href=\"http://www.jianbiaoku.com/webarbs/book/40/2409061.shtml\">GB 50118-2010 建标库</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"噪声控制-声源-路径-接收者三环节\">噪声控制：声源、路径、接收者三环节</h2><p>隔声是噪声控制的一部分，更完整的框架沿&quot;声源—传播路径—接收者&quot;三环节展开，这与 <a href=\"../light-and-vision/glare-and-visual-comfort\">眩光与视觉舒适</a> 中&quot;光源—界面—背景&quot;的治理链条异曲同工：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>声源控制</strong>：选用低噪设备、设备减振安装、风管消声器，从根上降噪，最有效。</li>\n<li><strong>路径控制</strong>：隔声墙、隔声窗、声屏障、消声、增加距离。室外交通噪声靠声屏障与隔声窗，机房噪声靠隔声+吸声双管齐下。</li>\n<li><strong>接收者控制</strong>：受声房间内做吸声处理降低混响、佩戴护听器，作为补充。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需要厘清隔声与吸声的区别：<strong>吸声</strong>降低的是同一房间内的混响和反射（属 <a href=\"room-acoustics-fundamentals\">室内声学基础</a>），<strong>隔声</strong>阻断的是房间之间的声音传递。机房既要隔声（不扰邻）又要吸声（机内不轰鸣），二者并用而非互替。室内背景噪声还会拉高语言交流和厅堂演出的本底，这一影响在 <a href=\"architectural-acoustics-design\">建筑声学设计（厅堂）</a> 中作为噪声评价（NR/NC 曲线）的设计约束再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>隔声分空气声隔声（阻止墙体振动传声）与撞击声隔声（断开固体声路径），机理对策截然不同。</li>\n<li>空气声隔声用隔声量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量，遵循质量定律（质量或频率翻倍约 +6 dB），多层复合墙更高效但有共振与吻合两个隔声谷。</li>\n<li>侧向传声与孔洞漏声是隔声的短板，再厚的墙也会被一条缝拖垮，密封堵漏性价比极高。</li>\n<li>撞击声靠隔振控制，浮筑楼板是住宅主流做法，用撞击声压级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{n,w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 评价（越小越好）。</li>\n<li>完整噪声控制沿声源、路径、接收者三环节展开；隔声阻断房间之间、吸声降低房间之内，二者并用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"隔声与噪声控制","id":"隔声与噪声控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两类隔声与隔声量","id":"核心概念-两类隔声与隔声量"},{"level":2,"text":"质量定律：空气声隔声的根本规律","id":"质量定律-空气声隔声的根本规律"},{"level":2,"text":"撞击声控制：从源头隔振","id":"撞击声控制-从源头隔振"},{"level":2,"text":"噪声控制：声源、路径、接收者三环节","id":"噪声控制-声源-路径-接收者三环节"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"室内声学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/room-acoustics-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"建筑声学设计（厅堂）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/architectural-acoustics-design"}}